event: content_block_delta
data: {"type": "content_block_delta", "index": 1, "delta": {"type": "text_delta", "text": "rapher with the expedition. Alongside Salma, you search for stolen surveys that threaten access to water. This historical fiction takes you from Alexandria to the Nile, Cairo and the pyramids of Giza."}}

